title":"Immunologically hot phenotype is associated with response to PD-1/PD-L1 inhibitors in patients with advanced head and neck squamous cell carcinoma.","summary":"Ongoing immunomodulatory strategies in tumors characterized by an overall hot immune phenotype may improve prognosis of head and neck squamous cell carcinomas (HNSCC). Our objective was to develop a reliable and stable scoring system for the identification of immunologically hot HNSCC and to evaluate its association with response to immunotherapies. A Hot Oral Tumor (HOT) score was developed using data from The Cancer Genome Atlas. HOT score was computed in 102 patients with HNSCC treated with immunotherapy targeting PD-1/PD-L1 in the context of clinical trials. High HOT score was associated with a statistically significant improved clinical outcome.","gpl":"18573","gse":"159067","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2022/07/07","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM4818558","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 20"},{"accession":"GSM4818604","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 66"},{"accession":"GSM4818601","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 63"},{"accession":"GSM4818621","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 83"},{"accession":"GSM4818564","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 26"},{"accession":"GSM4818584","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 46"},{"accession":"GSM4818581","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 43"},{"accession":"GSM4818544","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 6"},{"accession":"GSM4818627","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 89"},{"accession":"GSM4818624","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 86"},{"accession":"GSM4818541","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 3"},{"accession":"GSM4818561","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 23"},{"accession":"GSM4818613","title":"Targeted RNA of patient number 75"},{"accession":"