sis of publicly available datasets (PMCID: PMC6721309), is able to predict survival in an external patient cohort. The 3 gene expression clusters were tested in a validation set of 286 cases and in  a refined study population of 235 patients and in both confirmed their prognostic value. Five-year OS was 95% in the low risk cluster Cl1, 80% in the intermediate risk cluster (HR=5.74, p=.0057), and 66% in the high risk cluster (HR=9.28, p=.001). Functional/biological cluster characterization identified potentially targetable pathways in the high risk cluster.  This prognostic stratification might be useful for clinical decision making and for planning future trials based on molecular tumor features.","gpl":"23126","gse":"163173","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by array","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2021/11/03","suppfile":"CEL","samples":[{"accession":"GSM4974024","title":"HPV+OPC pts214"},{"accession":"GSM4974007","title":"HPV+OPC pts197"},{"accession":"GSM4974090","title":"HPV+OPC pts280"},{"accession":"GSM4973884","title":"HPV+OPC pts74"},{"accession":"GSM4973967","title":"HPV+OPC pts157"},{"accession":"GSM4974044","title":"HPV+OPC pts234"},{"accession":"GSM4973838","title":"HPV+OPC pts28"},{"accession":"GSM4973921","title":"HPV+OPC pts111"},{"accession":"GSM4973878","title":"HPV+OPC pts68"},{"accession":"GSM4973924","title":"HPV+OPC pts114"},{"accession":"GSM4974004","title":"HPV+OPC pts194"},{"accession":"GSM4974087","title":"HPV+OPC pts277"},{"accession":"GSM4973961","title":"HPV+OPC pts151"},{"accession":"GSM4974050","title":"HPV+OPC pts240"},{"accession":"GSM4973841","title":"HPV+OPC pts31"},{"accession":"GSM4973858","title":"HPV+OPC pts48"},{"accession":"GSM4973941","title":"HPV+OPC pts131"},{"accession":"GSM4974070","title":"HPV+OPC pts260"},{"accession":"GSM4973987","title":"HPV+OPC pts177"},{"accession":"GSM4973821","title":"HPV+OPC pts11"},{"accession":"GSM4973904","title":"HPV+OPC 